WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Start with Xavier’s email. Open Xavier’s email on your Android phone. Find the Wondercase app link. Keep Wi-Fi or mobile data on.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Tap the app link. Tap the app link once. Use Google Chrome for these steps. Otherwise, choose Open in Chrome if offered, or copy and paste using the next steps.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
If needed: copy the link. Return to the email. Touch and hold the app link, then choose Copy link address or Copy link.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Open Google Chrome. Find the round red, yellow, green and blue Chrome icon. Tap it to open the browser.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Paste and open the link. Tap Chrome’s address bar. Touch and hold, then choose Paste. Tap Go or the arrow on the keyboard to open the app.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Check the journey page. Wait for Wondercase to load. If the link was already open in Chrome, you can start here.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Open Chrome’s menu. Tap the three vertical dots next to the address bar. The address bar may be at the top or bottom, depending on your settings.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Choose the install option. Look for Install and create shortcut, then Install. Other Chrome versions may say Install app or Add to Home screen.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Confirm installation. Tap Install in the confirmation box. If your phone offers a shortcut instead, tap Add and follow the placement instructions.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Give it a moment. Allow the phone a moment to finish. Then go to your Home Screen using the Home button or your usual swipe-up gesture.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Find the new app. Look for the Wondercase icon. Swipe between Home Screen pages. If you do not see it, open your app list and search for it.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:48.000
If needed: place the icon. If the app is only in your app list, touch and hold its icon. Choose Add to Home, or drag it onto the Home Screen.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Tap to open your journey. Tap the new icon. You can now open the journey without returning to the email. Travelers do not need Xavier’s TD Login. Keep internet on for current updates.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:06.000
If Install is missing. Make sure the page is open in Chrome, not an email preview. Try a normal tab and reload. Check the app list first: Chrome may show Open app if it is already installed.
